          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba abena Moabu baleisa mukusansa icalo cila mwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshita imo ninshi abena Israeli baleshiika umuntu, nomba mukupumikisha ekwisa mona ibumba lya balesansa. Kanshi epakuposa icitumbi mu nindi yakwa Elisha. Nomba icitumbi caya kumya ku mafupa yakwe, noyu umuntu abuuka ukufuma ku bafwa aima aiminina na makasa yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
