          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasaeli imfumu ya bena Aramu afwa, elyo umwana mwaume wakwe Beni Hadadi amupyana pa bufumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yehoashi umwana mwaume wakwa Yehoahasi apokolola imisumba ukufuma kuli Beni Hadadi mwana wakwa Hasaeli, iyo apokele mukulwa ukufuma kuli wishi Yehoahasi. Pa miku itatu Yehoashi amucimfishe epo apokele ne misumba ya bena Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
